</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Uganda says it has no active Ebola cases, but infections in Kenya and Nigeria are prompting fresh scrutiny</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:85b05148fe9d66fcec28e83974135e2866e5a53849f839c31ffd863a6644152a</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:37:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T12:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uganda-says-it-has-no-active-ebola-cases-but-infections-in-kenya-and-nigeria-are-prompting-fresh-scr/a-79741580--819bf739b307.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uganda-says-it-has-no-active-ebola-cases-but-infections-in-kenya-and-nigeria-are-prompting-fresh-scrutiny/a-79741580?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Health officials are investigating whether Ebola patients in Kenya and Nigeria crossed paths at Uganda's main airport as conflicting accounts cloud the source of one infection.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Serbia: Hope, tension and apprehension as voters prepare to elect new parliament</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:600634f5f9dbbbc215efcd7cb7b13f92958df24b23d8c0ba221ad5d19a32b15b</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:37:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T11:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/serbia-hope-tension-and-apprehension-as-voters-prepare-to-elect-new-parliament/a-79738102--35e507b36c9f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/serbia-hope-tension-and-apprehension-as-voters-prepare-to-elect-new-parliament/a-79738102?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After two years of protests, Serbia faces a pivotal election on Sunday, with a student-led challenge to Aleksandar Vucic's lengthy rule. Allegations of electoral irregularities and fears of a post-election crisis abound.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>France: 1 killed, 4 wounded after shooting near Paris</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:60f4cb39f620b72153b269ad091c2751a6fbdd0a7253aad500d28be34678263a</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:37:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T11:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-1-killed-4-wounded-after-shooting-near-paris/a-79742256--05dc01bcf479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-1-killed-4-wounded-after-shooting-near-paris/a-79742256?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">French police have arrested a suspect after gunshots were fired in a town in the suburbs of Paris on Friday. Police are investigating a possible racist motivation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Sri Lanka: Death of iconic elephant raises habitat concerns</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bde7dabeaa317aaeb8704bdfc5d55affc892c906230c173fa01abc3c3e7b05de</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:37:52Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T09:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sri-lanka-death-of-iconic-elephant-raises-habitat-concerns/a-79735669--6048c81cd2f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sri-lanka-death-of-iconic-elephant-raises-habitat-concerns/a-79735669?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The death of what was thought to be Sri Lanka’s largest elephant has drawn attention to human-elephant conflict in rural communities. The island country sees a high number of deadly encounters.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Greece joins countries putting age-limits on social media, banning access for kids under 15</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb036e191801295f0eb8b753de7c3cb29d6937523d28f92f652c3bf53e56331a</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T09:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/greece-joins-countries-putting-age-limits-on-social-media-banning-access-for-kids-under-15/a-79739606--e768bcffaa49.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via