ck."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea proposes military talks with North again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c91889a4b7ca56f2e06ee422537eae2c283b105650ae1ad97f6c72c940fdafc6</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:04Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T07:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-proposes-military-talks-with-north-again/a-79739208--5b2219c381d9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-proposes-military-talks-with-north-again/a-79739208?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">South Korea is attempting to mutually determine the land border with North Korea amid military incidents and escalating tensions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany sit out FIFA Under-15 World Cup as Russia return</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bfcbb5829891b0cc8e6e5c7e967a2a9ba2ec5ee5bbe805d4ef58f38e84291a48</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:07Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T07:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-sit-out-fifa-under-15-world-cup-as-russia-return/a-79734040--d1c93bdcd718.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-sit-out-fifa-under-15-world-cup-as-russia-return/a-79734040?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany is one a handful of FIFA's 211 nations to refuse an invitation to play at the inaugural Under-15 World Cup. The tournament will also mark Russia's return to the FIFA fold.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Taiwan braces as El Nino-supercharged Typhoon Champi approaches island</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:91fde25d9e8d2c863fe1cbf89b96d001bdfd1666c3163fe1d8f7245f1e73e34c</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:10Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T06:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/taiwan-braces-as-el-nino-supercharged-typhoon-champi-approaches-island/a-79738819--5f04cbf55cee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/taiwan-braces-as-el-nino-supercharged-typhoon-champi-approaches-island/a-79738819?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One person has died and thousands have been evacuated as Taiwan prepares for a possible direct hit. Though no longer a "super" typhoon, Champi is still packing winds of nearly 200 kmh and will bring torrential rain.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Musk's Starshield system 'back' in Ukraine, says Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bc64a8d52674630369210da28861eb879ea6754ff30d9ce328a0198e3d14572b</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:14Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T05:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/musk-s-starshield-system-back-in-ukraine-says-trump/a-79738723--329222d51a85.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/musk-s-starshield-system-back-in-ukraine-says-trump/a-79738723?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Trump has said he wouldn't comment on who called for capping Ukraine's Starshield access but added that Elon Musk had "put it back." His account was rejected by Ukraine, which says nothing has changed.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Embarrassing name? How we live with names we don't like</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7832882226a0338807110f34aaa0ae9f6e60e69445c2e54e84585e11cfd4fae5</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T05:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/embarrassing-name-how-we-live-with-names-we-don-t-like/a-79724068--afb6ee0b7720.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/embarrassing-name-how-we-live-with-names-we-don-t-like/a-79724068?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Names are central to our identity, so what happens when that name is a source of ridicule? Research points to negative life outcomes, but some people learn to embrace unfortunate names.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Protesters march to Election Commission demanding CEC Gyanesh Kumar's resignation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:efe8670e295302be14abf210741393f5fb627e35c7061dc0978c98f4ab97b8ad</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:38:19Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T04:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-protesters-march-to-election-commission-demanding-cec-gyanesh-kumar-s-resignation/live-79738437--359ae058742e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-protesters-march-to-election-commission-demanding-cec-gyanesh-kumar-s-resignation/live-79738437?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A coalition of students, farmers and civil society groups have joined calls for Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar's resignation over India's voter roll revision exercise. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Serbia: Tens of thousands rally ahead of elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ec570eedb62bea7fa90387cdc94374563ed98da1c5d92eb2c0088f7dad012c2</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T03:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/serbia-tens-of-thousands-rally-ahead-of-elections/a-79738420--6d4a0cffd723.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/serbia-tens-of-thousands-rally-ahead-of-elections/a-79738420?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After two years of student-led protests, Serbia will soon vote in what observers describe as a referendum-like snap election pitting strongman Aleksandar Vucic against the student movement.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Airbnb scraps guest checkout chores such as cleaning</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae52e9e3b915d2b41ffefbcad81d96692873eadc4c95505e7e9be4a0c4244a42</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T02:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/airbnb-scraps-guest-checkout-chores-such-as-cleaning/a-79738340--615f4c6757d7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/airbnb-scraps-guest-checkout-chores-such-as-cleaning/a-79738340?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Under new rules, guests will no longer have to do tasks that cleaners would normally handle. Hosts can now only make "reasonable" requests, such as leaving dirty dishes in the sink and sorting trash from recycling.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tibet earthquake kills at least 16 people, injures dozens: state media</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9ce2dfdc2d51aff985ec78faec55c0f5035ae74ef50f38406a3c6d8aa11db0a3</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T23:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tibet-earthquake-kills-at-least-16-people-injures-dozens-state-media/a-79738117--804f662ec522.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tibet-earthquake-kills-at-least-16-people-injures-dozens-state-media/a-79738117?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A powerful magnitude 7 earthquake has struck Tibet in southwestern China, official media reported. Chinese state TV said it's the strongest quake to hit the remote Himalayan region in five years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland: Thousands protest for more abortion rights</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2adb7129489642b81b3a01f7404e8897ee227ac253be393bd63e2b5bc83802fa</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T20:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-thousands-protest-for-more-abortion-rights/a-79737572--177050ad6205.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-thousands-protest-for-more-abortion-rights/a-79737572?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Thousands rallied across Poland to demand abortion rights six years after a landmark court ruling tightened restrictions. The country has one of the strictest abortion rules in all of Europe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Albania's student protests are only getting bigger</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e804467992f6984b816dfa87b3ee9a88317eec4428cbeb8fcd8e6b1d34f84f45</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T19:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/albania-s-student-protests-are-only-getting-bigger/a-79735213--609bd8634d9d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/albania-s-student-protests-are-only-getting-bigger/a-79735213?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As police try to suppress anti-corruption protests by young Albanians, Prime Minister Edi Rama is claiming that "antifa" is behind the unrest. Few are buying that explanation.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Lina Attalah: Mada Masr journalist sent for trial in Egypt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:65bd3beefa552923fa931257c7cd5127f5c3a0054e3319108de384bb7da13307</id><updated>2026-10-23T13:36:39Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T19:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/lina-attalah-mada-masr-journalist-sent-for-trial-in-egypt/a-79736647--9d0c54466c32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/lina-attalah-mada-masr-journalist-sent-for-trial-in-egypt/a-79736647?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Lina Attalah, who is accused of managing a website without a license, will go to court next week. Mada Masr has published reporting critical of Egyptian President Abdel-Fattah el-Sissi's government.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
